  lines:
  - speaker: 1
    speakerName: Slime Girl
    text: Aahnn... beaten down while burning from inside... every drop of my core
      is trembling...
    playerExpression: Normal
    enemyEmotion: lust_joy
  - speaker: 0
    speakerName: You
    text: You pushed yourself to exhaustion. Can you even hold your shape anymore?
    playerExpression: Smile
    enemyEmotion: lust_joy
  - speaker: 1
    speakerName: Slime Girl
    text: M-My slime is so warm... if you touch me again right now, I'll melt into
      sweet syrup...
    playerExpression: Normal
    enemyEmotion: lust_suprised
  - speaker: 2
    speakerName: Narrator
    text: The dazed Slime Girl puddles helplessly at your boots, completely drained
      of fighting will.
    playerExpression: Smug
    enemyEmotion: lust_suprised
